2026-10-12T09:51:29.7027491Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7127925Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7138225Z [0m
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7139001Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7139588Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7140243Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7140825Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7141714Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7142213Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7142684Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7143411Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7143724Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7144580Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7145246Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7145743Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7146115Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7146288Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7146529Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7146802Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7147088Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7147495Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7147631Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7148012Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7148252Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7148659Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7149181Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7151889Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7152054Z I will:
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7152299Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7152594Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7153046Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7153895Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7154563Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7154852Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7155158Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7155902Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7156583Z    /root
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7168198Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7169177Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7180946Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7181905Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7182379Z 
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7182960Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-12T09:51:29.7183582Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
